  "summary": "A medical study conducted at a tertiary care center in Chennai examining the occurrence of paraneoplastic syndrome in patients with bronchogenic carcinoma. The study appears to be a clinical investigation focused on understanding the relationship between these conditions.",
  "content": "The study investigates the occurrence of paraneoplastic syndrome among patients diagnosed with bronchogenic carcinoma at a tertiary care facility in Chennai. While the complete content details are not provided in the source material, the research appears to be a clinical investigation examining the correlation between bronchogenic carcinoma and associated paraneoplastic syndromes. The study was conducted in a healthcare setting specializing in advanced medical care and treatment.\n\nThe research aims to contribute to the understanding of paraneoplastic manifestations in lung cancer patients, which could potentially aid in early diagnosis and improved patient care.",
